Design credit
-------------

The shape of this stack - local open-vocabulary perception, one tool call per
planner turn, a hard step budget, a JSON trace of every decision - follows the
WRC DM pipeline that was prototyped earlier in this project. No source code from
it is copied or imported here; this package stands alone.


Robot safety
------------

This software commands a physical arm. It is not safety-rated. Keep the physical
E-stop within reach, start with `dry_run:=true`, then `use_fake_hardware:=true`,
and only then the real controller.
